 leave and join any game except game 1 your waypoints won't won't show up because you're not in game 1, next time again when u join game 1 you will see those exact 3 waypoints you made, this works for all the games. Y'all should've understood how it works y'all aren't kids.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTags (ignore): waypoint, waypoints, waypoint-gui, waypoint-system, saved-waypoints, auto-waypoints, infinite-waypoints, unlimited-waypoints, teleport, teleport-script, teleport-gui, teleport-tool, tp, tp-script, tp-gui, saved-teleport, fast-teleport, instant-teleport, position-teleport, coords-teleport, coordinate-teleport, autosave, auto-save, auto-saving, persistent, persistence, persistent-data, persistent-save, file-save, file-saving, readfile, writefile, json, json-save, json-storage, file-storage, local-storage, executor-storage, session-save, rejoin-save, leave-save, join-load, auto-load, gui, ui, modern-gui, clean-gui, simple-gui, custom-gui, draggable, draggable-gui, toggle, toggle-gui, movable-gui, floating-gui, touch-gui, mobile-gui, pc-gui, tablet-gui, responsive-ui, smooth-ui, roblox, roblox-script, roblox-exploit, roblox-hack, roblox-gui, roblox-teleport, roblox-waypoint, roblox-tool, roblox-utility, roblox-qol, roblox-ui, roblox-localplayer, roblox-cframe, executor, executor-script, executor-only, exploit, exploit-script, exploit-gui, synapse, krnl, fluxus, scriptware, delta, electron, hydrogen, codex, trigon, vega-x, utility, utility-script, quality-of-life, qol, tool, game-tool, map-tool, navigation, navigation-tool, travel, fast-travel, checkpoint, checkpoint-system, location-saver, position-saver, coordinate-saver, humanoidrootpart, rootpart, cframe, set-cframe, teleport-cframe, player-position, player-coords, vector3, workspace, localplayer, infinite, unlimited, dynamic, scalable, scrolling, scroll-frame, scrollingframe, ui-list, ui-layout, uilistlayout, theme, themed-ui, colorful, neon, space-theme, dark-ui, dark-theme, modern-theme, premium-ui, sleek-ui, anti-sk